l-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/01/17/282941837/b9d1312cb77fd12cc42c8a3e33c1d788_6659216617094470944.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>始源之律者</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">最佳推荐武器，显著提高了角色的输出能力，武器主动的格挡也与角色的机制相得益彰。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/01/18/282941837/f2842350296342fca85223dae40d0b3a_6691580716208301081.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>夜隐重霞</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">提供一定的面板与雷伤，提高了角色的输出能力。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/01/18/282941837/4b7218acb5b48bb466f337ddea984509_3094307886333894122.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">澄凝之钥的超限形态，提供了全元素易伤和高额的雷伤，并在触发时滞领域时提供可叠加的全伤。主动技能进行斩击并在动作期间格挡攻击，格挡成功时提高雷伤并回复能量，提供了一定的输出和循环能力。始源之律者使用时通过【意业诛殛】可以主动触发格挡，且格挡成功可以触发时滞领域并派生连斩，同时为【翼刃】填充一层【由序缭转】，显著优化了流程。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/01/18/282941837/4b7218acb5b48bb466f337ddea984509_3094307886333894122.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
